  "request": {
    "raw": "Design a 1.2V MOS-only voltage reference in GF180MCU (gf180mcuD) with ports VDD VSS VREF IBIAS where IBIAS is an external bias current input. VDD = 3.3 V, VSS = 0 V, IBIAS = 20 uA nominal, CL = 1 pF, 27 C. Use MOSFET-only circuitry (nfet_03v3 / pfet_03v3) \u2014 no BJTs, no bandgap, no explicit resistors or reference-setting capacitors. VREF nominal 1.20 V and allowed 1.15-1.25 V; temperature coefficient <= 300 ppm/C over -40..125 C; line regulation <= 100 mV/V over 3.0-3.6 V; VREF variation over 3.0-3.6 V <= 60 mV; supply current excluding IBIAS <= 300 uA. Characterize IBIAS sensitivity at 10/20/30 uA, supply behaviour from ~2.7-3.6 V, and PVT (VDD 3.0/3.3/3.6 V, temp -40/27/125 C, gf180 typical/ff/ss corners).",
